(\(\Delta\phi\sim 0\)) with respect to the away side (\(\Delta\phi\sim\pi\)) of the jet produce in the three colliding systems. The away side jet (\(\Delta\phi\sim\pi\)) of the \(Au+Au\) central collision system suppressed completely due to the jet-quenching phenomenon.

